WEBVTT

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.176
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.886
I study how to make work not suck.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.262
In this show, I'm inviting
myself inside the minds

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:07.831
of some truly unusual people,

00:03:07.855 --> 00:03:11.186
because they mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.686
Today: loneliness at work.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:16.176
It can happen even if
you're surrounded by people,

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.238
but you don't have to fight it alone.

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:21.163
Thanks to SAP for sponsoring this episode.

00:03:21.805 --> 00:03:24.388
(WorkLife theme music)

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:30.096
VM: When we are lonely,